    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The ancient road that linked Segovia to Titulcia passes through Las Rozas, and today that stretch is the modern A6/M505.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
